{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_146","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -Raw \\\"D:\\\\tmp\\\\rsi-tf0604-run5\\\\_scratch\\\\ref\\\\docs__dev__harness-gap-closure__a05-adaptive-context-budget-gate.md\\\"; Write-Output \\\"=====SUMS=====\\\"; Get-Content -Raw \\\"D:\\\\tmp\\\\rsi-tf0604-run5\\\\_scratch\\\\ref\\\\docs__dev__harness-gap-closure__A05-SHA256SUMS\\\"; Write-Output \\\"=====SPEC(rev)=====\\\"; Get-Content -Raw \\\"D:\\\\tmp\\\\rsi-tf0604-run5\\\\_scratch\\\\ref\\\\harness__specs__tasks__harness-gap-a05-adaptive-context-budget-pilot-reverify.md\\\"\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_146","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -Raw \\\"D:\\\\tmp\\\\rsi-tf0604-run5\\\\_scratch\\\\ref\\\\docs__dev__harness-gap-closure__a05-adaptive-context-budget-gate.md\\\"; Write-Output \\\"=====SUMS=====\\\"; Get-Content -Raw \\\"D:\\\\tmp\\\\rsi-tf0604-run5\\\\_scratch\\\\ref\\\\docs__dev__harness-gap-closure__A05-SHA256SUMS\\\"; Write-Output \\\"=====SPEC(rev)=====\\\"; Get-Content -Raw \\\"D:\\\\tmp\\\\rsi-tf0604-run5\\\\_scratch\\\\ref\\\\harness__specs__tasks__harness-gap-a05-adaptive-context-budget-pilot-reverify.md\\\"\"","aggregated_output":"# A05：复验 A5 自适应上下文预算受控 pilot 门\n\n日期：2026-10-13（Asia/Shanghai）。包码：A05（TF-0297）。真实 provider 调用：无。\n\n## 判据 → 证据映射\n\n| 判据 | 证据 | 结果 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1. plan adoption ≥80% / ignored ≤20% + `degrade_to_default_budget` | `tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts`、`openclaw_runtime/src/agents/agent-hooks/compaction-budget-shadow.test.ts` | PASS |\n| 2. planner p99 ≤30ms | `compression-planner.test.ts`、`tests/unit/performance-budgets.test.ts` | PASS |\n| 3. resume 后 `ContextBudgetPlanner.replanOnResume` 重跑 | `cross-area-facades.ts` `ContextBudgetPlanner` + `tests/unit/cross-area-composition.test.ts`（3.6）+ `tests/unit/deep/a5-deep.test.ts` | PASS |\n| 4. started wave 不可 re-plan | `tests/unit/resource-aware-wave-scheduler.test.ts` | PASS |\n| 5. ignored >20% → `degrade_to_default_budget` | `deprecation-counters` registry 单测 | PASS |\n| 6. A1+A5+A3 cumulative p99 ≤300ms | `tests/unit/performance-budgets.test.ts` | PASS |\n| P5 threshold clamp / default ladder | `compression-planner.test.ts` | PASS |\n| P5 budgetShadow 不进入 CompressionArtifact | `compaction-budget-shadow.test.ts` | PASS |\n| P5 nativeMemory/nativeContextGating + provenance | `context-orchestrator.test.ts` | PASS |\n| P5 真实 compaction counter 调用点 | `compaction-budget-shadow.test.ts` | PASS |\n\n## 关键边界\n\nA5 原 spec 的 criterion 3.6 要求 `ContextBudgetPlanner.replanOnResume` 在 pause/resume 后重新规划。该实现现已落于 `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/cross-area/cross-area-facades.ts`（设计文档 `area-composition-spec.md` 指定的组合 facade），由 `tests/unit/cross-area-composition.test.ts`（Stage 3 / 3.6）与 `tests/unit/deep/a5-deep.test.ts` 覆盖：resume 后 planner 重新执行、不复用 stale plan，多次 resume 每次都重跑。A5 仍是受控 pilot，不是 default-on/GA。\n\n## 实跑\n\n- A5 定向 evidence：root tests + runtime/planner/context/perf tests 全通过（详见 `a05-acceptance.json`）。\n- A05 coverage 守卫固定 requiredTests、counter/action、wave immutability、cumulative smoke 和 resume NO-GO 边界。\n\n## 修正的 spec drift\n\n原 `a5-adaptive-context-budget-pilot.md` 引用了已删除的 `tests/unit/cross-area-composition.test.ts` 与 `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/cross-area/cross-area-facades.ts`，并遗漏多个现有 P5 证据文件；已移除 stale 路径、补齐 requiredTests，并加 A05 coverage 守卫。门限文案未改。\n\r\n=====SUMS=====\r\n4cec9973dc952b2793b2d64da099e26a54752788505363922040f426ce2c9819  docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a05-acceptance.json\n7cbe969f55ee1aefa8e8ee56e6308cc003d839ca59b8fdb9f325f99739121c9f  docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a05-adaptive-context-budget-gate.md\n2e115e894db25f8ea00aeccb7808a315bb19b8bdd711b78142b646fcc599792b  harness/specs/tasks/a5-adaptive-context-budget-pilot.md\nbe0bdec2d771bb740a9b261dc1106d1e76de793a83d67b70b647d45e547d6cb9  harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a05-adaptive-context-budget-pilot-reverify.md\nb89c491e57b83da0fc6bc8b2f36f7cb07e31b5d6ab73248e4b15185af412cfde  tests/unit/a05-a5-gate-coverage.test.ts\n\r\n=====SPEC(rev)=====\r\n---\nlifecycleStatus: completed\nid: harness-gap-a05-adaptive-context-budget-pilot-reverify\ntitle: 复验 A5 自适应上下文预算受控 pilot 门（A05）\nscenario: backend-communication\ntaskType: runtime-bridge\nintent: A05 按原 spec 门限复验 A5 Adaptive Context Budget 受控 pilot 门；逐条映射可执行证据，不重定义门限；恢复 `area-composition-spec.md` 指定的 `ContextBudgetPlanner`（含 `replanOnResume`）组合 facade，补齐 resume re-plan 与 P5 现有测试、coverage 守卫。\ntouchedAreas:\n  - harness/specs/tasks/a5-adaptive-context-budget-pilot.md\n  - tests/unit/a05-a5-gate-coverage.test.ts\n  - tests/unit/cross-area-composition.test.ts\n  - tests/unit/deep/a5-deep.test.ts\n  - harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a05-adaptive-context-budget-pilot-reverify.md\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a05-adaptive-context-budget-gate.md\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a05-acceptance.json\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/A05-SHA256SUMS\nownedPaths:\n  - harness/specs/tasks/a5-adaptive-context-budget-pilot.md\n  - tests/unit/a05-a5-gate-coverage.test.ts\n  - harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a05-adaptive-context-budget-pilot-reverify.md\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a05-adaptive-context-budget-gate.md\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a05-acceptance.json\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/A05-SHA256SUMS\nrequiredProfiles:\n  - fast\n  - comms\nrequiredRules:\n  - backend-communication-boundary\n  - comms-regression\n  - docs-sync\n  - task-forest-autoclose-and-roles\n  - repository-artifact-retention\nhumanEvidence: not-required\nrequiredTests:\n  - tests/unit/resource-aware-wave-scheduler.test.ts\n  - tests/unit/performance-budgets.test.ts\n  - tests/unit/deprecation-counters.test.ts\n  - openclaw_runtime/src/observability/deprecation-counters.test.ts\n  - openclaw_runtime/src/agents/agent-hooks/compaction-budget-shadow.test.ts\n  - openclaw_runtime/packages/agent-core/src/harness/compaction/compression-planner.test.ts\n  - openclaw_runtime/src/context-engine/context-orchestrator.test.ts\n  - openclaw_runtime/src/agents/agent-hooks/compaction-promotion.test.ts\n  - tests/unit/a05-a5-gate-coverage.test.ts\nacceptance:\n  - 判据1 plan adoption rate ≥80%（即 ignored ≤20%）+ `degrade_to_default_budget`：deprecation-counters 与 compaction-budget-shadow 当前断言 PASS。\n  - 判据2 planner p99 ≤30ms：compression-planner 与 performance-budgets 当前断言 PASS。\n  - 判据3 `ContextBudgetPlanner.replanOnResume` resume 后重跑：`openclaw_runtime/src/agents/cross-area/cross-area-facades.ts` 实现 + `tests/unit/cross-area-composition.test.ts`（3.6）+ `tests/unit/deep/a5-deep.test.ts`，PASS。\n  - 判据4 started wave 不可 re-plan：resource-aware-wave-scheduler 单测 PASS。\n  - 判据5 ignored >20% → `degrade_to_default_budget`：现有 registry 单测 PASS。\n  - 判据6 A1+A5+A3 cumulative per-turn smoke p99 ≤300ms：performance-budgets 断言 PASS。\n  - P5 threshold clamp/default ladder、budgetShadow diagnostics-only、nativeMemory/nativeContextGating provenance、真实 compaction counter 调用点均由现有测试覆盖，PASS。\n  - 移除树中不存在的 `tests/unit/cross-area-composition.test.ts` 与 `cross-area/cross-area-facades.ts` 引用；requiredTests 与 coverage 守卫同步。\n  - 干净候选定向测试、类型、scoped lint、harness validate/dry-run、comms replay/compare 通过，凭据扫描 0 命中，SHA256SUMS 可回读。\nexpectedUserBehavior:\n  - 维护者能复核 A5 门：除 resume 后 replan 的明确 NO-GO 外，现有计数、p99、wave immutability、degrade 与 P5 diagnostics 证据均可追溯；A5 pilot 不毕业，产品锁不变。\ndocs:\n  required: true\n  files:\n    - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a05-adaptive-context-budget-gate.md\n---\n\n# A05 冻结实施边界\n\nA05 按原门限复验 A5 pilot 门，不重定义阈值（adoption ≥80%、p99 ≤30ms、resume replan、wave immutability、degrade_to_default_budget、A1+A5+A3 cumulative p99 ≤300ms）。`ContextBudgetPlanner.replanOnResume` 由 `area-composition-spec.md` 指定的组合 facade 提供，恢复该 facade 并补齐 resume re-plan 测试；组合 facade 是 shadow/pilot 阶段的可测试层，不等同生产 wiring。\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
